{"unit_id":"feely0208__dsh-teardown-studio#readme-2","repo":"feely0208/dsh-teardown-studio","commit":"7cdc860241f67aa9f1a9e8a0e80df7d23fcd1f23","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@deepwhale-cn/dsh-teardown-studio README · 安装：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add @deepwhale-cn/dsh-teardown-studio\n```\n\n装完重启 DeepWhale Desktop，右下角进入「深鲸拆解」。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"feely0208__dsh-teardown-studio#readme-3","repo":"feely0208/dsh-teardown-studio","commit":"7cdc860241f67aa9f1a9e8a0e80df7d23fcd1f23","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@deepwhale-cn/dsh-teardown-studio README · 能力：- 内置无人机成品 42 秒管线（带音效、端卡）；\n- 上传分件 GLB → 15 秒通用拆解；\n- 模板 #01 / #02；\n- 本地背景图片/视频、本地音乐；\n- 本地模型缓存，下次秒开；\n- 不内置 Chromium / ffmpeg：使用本机 Chrome/Edge + ffmpeg，缺失时界面提示。","source":"extracted","section":"能力"}
